refused: d259_unit_after_min.cy:10:24, line 10 column 24
10 |     let $d: f64.stable[min: 0.0, unit: length.meters] = 5.0 length.meters;
   |                        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 fix:  `unit: length.meters, min: 0.0`
 why:  a type reads as what it measures, then its range in that unit, so its labels go `unit:`, `min:`, `max:` (D259)
